Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如何？你感觉好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不...我不...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定不诚实...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,…即使你的身体如此简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,使用手指不公平 七瀬！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不公平？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好...每当你碰我 我的身体...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体开始发热...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 只有我能对你这么做...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太深了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,正如七瀬所说...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体感觉这么热
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我和他在一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.93,0:01:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}不 不...我要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是七瀬右介
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是...我已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我来了！来了！来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,床垫感觉比平常柔软...感觉很好...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,闻起来像咖啡...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上午
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要咖啡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这太尴尬了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在该怎么面对他？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你修床毛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不必！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 来吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们这样做时 感觉昨晚发生的事情就像一场梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,星谷...嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以假设我们现在是那样的 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我说...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,…我把它当作我们约会 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们有很多东西坏了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...我很抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...等待...呵呵？昨晚我们做了这么多...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,您看到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,作为发型师 我真的不够熟练
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想先正确地成为一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要有自信 值得你在身边陪着 七瀬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 听起来很自负 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你能再给我点时间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你坦诚的那部分是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么说...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好的...在那之前...别骗我 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能...谁会想到事情会变成这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.82,0:03:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的性感觉很棒...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.03,0:03:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,平野 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我是！怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始的新业务
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,终于起飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了你不少负担
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,您不再需要给我寄钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很感谢你一直以来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只在我确实需要的时候才使用您要寄的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一点一点偿还 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以从现在开始你应该自己花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为我自己...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...可能有点太贵了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您的购买！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我-我买了它！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,祝您有愉快的一天！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,平野 你今天看起来真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,星谷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有空吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要告诉你一些重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:05:01.36,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(500 200)\blur3}お前の髪が前とは違う
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:07.24,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}輝きに見えてきてしまって
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:12.08,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}静かに深くこの音が鳴って
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:17.08,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}求め始めたのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.84,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}最初は逆だったはずの
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.59,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}ちぐはぐな愛情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:27.59,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}もう戻せない
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:32.68,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}ただ時計の針は進んで
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:37.65,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}俺たちの距離感を少しずつ変えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:41.77,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}今届けそうで届かない指が
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.78,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}また一つ空回りしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:49.24,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}どうすればいいのかさえ分からない
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:52.62,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}鏡越しに目が逢う瞬間の
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.58,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}想いがあふれて止まらない
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:06:04.01,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 90)\fad(200 200)\blur3}自分だけのものにしたくなってしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:10.43,ED Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200 500)\blur3}欲張りだとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:05:01.36,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(500 200)\blur3}你的头发和上次不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:07.24,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}现在看起来光彩夺目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:12.08,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}这个声音会轻轻地产生更深的共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:17.08,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我的愿望开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.84,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我应该有相反的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.59,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}这段冲突的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:27.59,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}现在没有回头路了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:32.68,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}时钟只能向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:37.65,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我们的距离感一点一点地改变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:41.77,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}似乎我能用手指接触到你 但却不能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.78,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我又一次不知从哪儿冒出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:49.24,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我都不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:52.62,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}当我们的眼睛在镜子中相遇时 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.58,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}我无法控制我的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:06:04.01,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640 695)\fad(200 200)\blur3}现在我只想让你成为我的 
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.80,0:06:10.43,ED Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200 500)\blur3}听起来像所有格
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.28,0:06:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(750.5 40)}我们的商店下周会等你！
